WEBVTT

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:03.819
My name is Jordan and I'm from Indiana.
我叫乔丹，来自印第安纳州。

00:00:03.819 --> 00:00:06.854
Last summer I started my third viewing of how I met your mother.
去年夏天，我开始第三次观看我是如何认识你母亲的。

00:00:06.854 --> 00:00:13.256
My first girlfriend had just broken up with me, and the show felt like the only thing that could get me through those first three days.
我的第一个女朋友刚刚和我分手，这部剧感觉是唯一能让我度过前三天的事情。

00:00:13.256 --> 00:00:15.911
I remember watching Return of the Shirt very distinctly.
我记得非常清楚地看过《衬衫归来》。

00:00:15.911 --> 00:00:18.425
I was practically shouting at Ted the entire episode.
整集我几乎都在对特德大喊大叫。

00:00:18.425 --> 00:00:27.482
While the topic hit a little close to home at that point, I realized how interesting it was to be able to view this show with that new perspective, one of someone who had been broken up with.
虽然这个话题当时有点切中要害，但我意识到能够以一种新的视角（一个已经分手的人）来观看这个节目是多么有趣。

00:00:27.482 --> 00:00:29.332
I think that's the beauty of this show.
我认为这就是这个节目的美妙之处。

00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:32.130
I get something new out of it every single time I watch it.
每次看它我都会从中得到新的东西。

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:53.659
I'll be soon in New York City, when I see you, please permit me to tell you everything of city.
我很快就会到纽约市，当我见到你时，请允许我告诉你这座城市的一切。

00:00:53.659 --> 00:00:55.820
Hello, welcome to how we made your mother.
你好，欢迎来到我们如何创造你的母亲。

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.060
I'm Josh Radner.
我是乔什·拉德纳。

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:02.659
