我总是告诉人们我在 20 多岁的时候开始了这个节目。

00:02:23.259 --> 00:02:25.900
I was, I think I was like 28 or 29.
我当时大概是 28 或 29 岁。

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:28.500
I started the show like single.
我像单身一样开始了这个节目。

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:36.219
I had just started dating my now husband and I left the show a mother of two like staring down 40.
我刚刚开始和我现在的丈夫约会，当我离开节目时，我已经是两个孩子的母亲了，就像凝视着 40 岁的人一样。

00:02:36.219 --> 00:03:04.500
So it was those like, And I feel like what was great about it is all of us, we're kind of in that sort of same age bracket and we were going through what the gang was going through and that was totally informing the stories, like Lilian Marshall getting married, starting to have children, career stuff, like we were going through it with the gang and I think it was like, and we were all going through it.
所以，我觉得这件事的伟大之处在于我们所有人，我们都在同一年龄段，我们正在经历这帮人正在经历的事情，这完全是故事的内容，比如莉莲·马歇尔结婚，开始生孩子，职业生涯，就像我们和这帮人一起经历它一样，我认为我们都在经历它。

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:08.259
You know, the cast was going through their things, the writers, the crew, everybody.
你知道，演员们、编剧、工作人员、每个人都在检查他们的事情。

00:03:08.259 --> 00:03:14.460
It wasn't like the Hollywood, you know, 28 year olds playing high school students kind of like silliness.
这不像好莱坞，你知道，28 岁的人扮演高中生有点愚蠢。

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:20.659
Like we were, we were in the pocket of the era that we were, we were showing, you know?
就像我们一样，我们处于我们所处时代的口袋里，我们正在展示，你知道吗？

00:03:20.659 --> 00:03:24.979
And the writing, the writing staff wasn't like these grizzled veterans who'd been doing it lots of years.
而写作，写作人员并不像这些已经干了很多年的头发花白的退伍军人。

00:03:24.979 --> 00:03:29.259
And if this show doesn't work out, we'll go on to some other show like this was our shot, right?
如果这个节目不成功，我们会继续其他节目，就像我们的镜头一样，对吗？

00:03:29.259 --> 00:03:30.259
This was our show.
这是我们的表演。

00:03:30.259 --> 00:03:31.259
This was going to be our show.
这将是我们的表演。

00:03:31.259 --> 00:03:42.821
We're the same age as the cast, Courtney, you were a little younger than me, but we were basically contemporaries and it felt like we were all sharing material and sharing stories and we all spoke the same language and I think that was like so key.
我们和演员们同龄，考特尼，你比我年轻一点，但我们基本上是同时代的人，感觉我们都在分享材料和故事，我们都说着同样的语言，我认为这很关键。

00:03:42.821 --> 00:03:43.939
It's really interesting.
这真的很有趣。

00:03:43.939 --> 00:03:47.415
Okay, so return of the shirt is of course a dating episode.
好吧，归还衬衫当然是约会的插曲。

