He's just he never even explains why it's really is he just it's enough Oh, yeah, so Courtney also do you remember like where the the shirt that kind of talismanic object of the episode came from?
他只是他从来没有解释过为什么真的是他就足够了哦，是的，所以考特尼你还记得这一集的那种护身符的衬衫是从哪里来的吗？

