I was I can't remember I couldn't remember that I feel like that was your pitch I feel like that like that idea of going back in your like the shirt is this key that unlocks a door into the past that leads to her right?
我不记得了，我不记得了，我觉得那是你的推销方式，我觉得就像穿着你的衬衫回到过去的想法，就像这件衬衫是一把钥匙，可以打开通往过去的大门，通向她，对吗？

